  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Accordion fold book, printed and collaged on both sides, housed in miniature tote bag with title, author, and publisher printed on it. Book contains prints, each monotone, but in different colors. At end of story, note is found within folded sheet collaged on page and closed with a sewn button with a thick green thread to tie it shut.</subfield>
